teacher_info.teaching_style:
With my extensive experience in the language field, I am committed to assisting you with kindness and patience.
Each class is designed to ensure you make progress and learn something new each time!

Our lessons will include:
🤓 Grammar: Explanations and exercises;
👂 Listening: Videos, dialogues, etc.;
📖 Reading: Text comprehension to expand your vocabulary;
🗣️ Speaking: Conversation on various topics to help you gain fluency.

🎉 We will also have fun with interactive games, quizzes, and flashcards
✍️ You will receive homework to practice your written skills and reinforce learning between classes (optional, but strongly recommended)
💡 I will also make sure to share cultural insights!
